<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>문의하기 | BOTANICA LAB</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div>
            <h1>BOTANICA LAB</h1>
            <p>YOUR SPACE, YOUR PLANT.</p>
        </div>

        <nav>
            <a href="/">홈</a>
            <a href="/about">브랜드 소개</a>
            <a href="/plants">식물 도감</a>
            <a href="/recommend">식물 추천</a>
            <a href="/care">식물 관리</a>
            <a href="/shop">스토어</a>
            <a href="/contact">문의하기</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="contact-main">
        <h2>무엇이든 문의해 주세요.</h2>
        <p>식물과 공간에 관한 궁금한 점을 남겨주세요.</p>

        <section class="plant-information">
            <form action="/contact" method="POST">
                <h3>문의 내용</h3>

                <p>이름</p>
                <input type="text" name="name" required>

                <p>이메일</p>
                <input type="email" name="email" required>

                <p>문의 내용</p>
                <textarea name="message" required></textarea>

                <button type="submit">문의 보내기</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
